          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid editorial">
          <article class="story-card">
            <div class="story-media">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 480 280" role="img" aria-label="Styled shelf with neutral objects">
                <rect width="480" height="280" rx="24" fill="#121c29"/>
                <rect x="66" y="56" width="348" height="28" rx="14" fill="#243247"/>
                <rect x="96" y="104" width="88" height="104" rx="18" fill="#d0d7e2"/>
                <rect x="214" y="92" width="72" height="118" rx="18" fill="#7f95ad"/>
                <rect x="314" y="118" width="84" height="92" rx="18" fill="#9a7f5b"/>
                <circle cx="136" cy="144" r="18" fill="#7f95ad"/>
                <circle cx="250" cy="128" r="14" fill="#d0d7e2"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="story-body">
              <div>
                <h3>How to build a five-piece home refresh</h3>
                <p class="muted">The easiest way to update a room without starting over.</p>
              </div>
              <a class="story-link" href="#deals">Read the guide</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="story-card">
            <div class="story-media">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 480 280" role="img" aria-label="Model wearing neutral layers outdoors">
                <rect width="480" height="280" rx="24" fill="#101824"/>
                <circle cx="340" cy="84" r="52" fill="rgba(127,209,255,0.1)"/>
                <path d="M184 188c18-72 68-118 122-118 42 0 68 24 84 62l20 76H164l20-20Z" fill="#d8c7a7"/>
                <rect x="202" y="96" width="110" height="102" rx="26" fill="#384b62"/>
                <rect x="228" y="86" width="56" height="64" rx="28" fill="#f1d7b6"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="story-body">
              <div>
                <h3>Layering neutrals without looking flat</h3>
